    title: "Yemeni government forces report nearly 700 strikes against Houthis",
    summary: "Yemeni government forces report nearly 700 strikes against Houthis Yemeni government forces say they carried out 697 strikes targeting the Iran-aligned Houthis over the past few hours, the army’s spokesperson Majed al-Nuzaili said. Al-Nuzaili said in a post on X that the attacks included 17 air strikes, 32 drone attacks, 28 rocket attacks and 620 artillery attacks targeting Houthi positions, gatherings, vehicles and weapons depots. These strikes killed 97 Houthi commanders and fighters and destroyed or damaged 76 vehicles and combat assets, he said. The government forces and their allies continue to repel Houthi attacks in Taiz amid ongoing clashes on the Marib and al Jawf fronts, he added.",
